video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Prison Security Guard", "keywords": ["sandbox", "prison", "guard", "comedy", "humor"], "long_description": "# Welcome to the Intake Station\n\n**Prison Security Guard is a VR job simulator and hilarious comic sandbox** where you take on the role of a guard processing a highly unpredictable, cartoonish intake line\n\n**Inspect** pockets, search belongings, sanitize inmates, and correct their uniforms or hair before sending them through the final gate\n\n**Run a flawless, professional operation**  to maximize your score, or tear up the rulebook and unleash complete sandbox chaos\u2014in this prison, mistakes only make things funnier!\n\n# Key Features\n\n- **Physically search** pockets, shave overgrown beards, hose off dripping mud, and use a laser to erase banned tattoos\n\n- **Every Inmate is a Toy**: Interact with characters designed for physical comedy\n\n- **Stress-Free \"No Game Over\" Play:** Focus on the fun\n\n- **Slapstick Sandbox Arsenal**: Earn Guard Tokens on your shift to unlock purely optional, chaotic toys\n\n# Join Our Community!\nWant to share your funniest VR clips, get exclusive development updates, or chat directly with the creators?\n\n\ud83d\udc7e Join the official Prison Security Guard Discord: **https://discord.com/invite/etermaxrstudio**", "short_description": "Step into the boots of the only sensible guard in an absurd VR prison intake!\n- Inspect, clean, and prepare a line of cartoonish inmates using highly tactile physical tools\n\n- Confiscate bizarre contraband, or cause absolute chaos with an arsenal of slapstick toys\n\n- Follow security protocols to the letter or break every single rule\u2014there is no game over in this hilarious comic sandbox!"}]}, "developer_name": "etermax XR Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.etermax.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.etermax.com/terms/", "publisher_name": "etermax XR Studio", "su